Chipo starts a dressmaking enterprise in Masvingo on 1 April with US\$300 in the bank. She expects:

- cash sales: April US\$1,850, May US\$2,150, June US\$1,530;
- materials: April US\$700, May US\$820, June US\$650;
- wages of US\$500 and rent of US\$250 every month;
- a second-hand sewing machine for US\$640, paid in June.

Prepare her cash budget for April to June by answering the parts below.
